+// QGF1: ordered floating-point cull and vertex preparation ahead of raster.
+// Input jobs remain in the ingress ring until their complete run is emitted.
+// The private output FIFO contains values, never references to snapshot RAM.
+// Unsupported cull arithmetic pauses before any output from that run and is
+// repaired from its immutable operands without consulting live software state.
+`default_nettype none
+module gpu_queued_front #(
+ parameter ADDR_BITS=12, parameter QUEUE_BITS=9
